  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/MisanthropyDev\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/donate/patreon-singular_64h.png\" alt=\"Patreon\" height=\"32\"> </a> &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://github.com/Linggango/Linggango\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/social/github-plural_64h.png\" alt=\"GitHub\" height=\"32\"> </a> &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/linggango\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/curseforge_64h.png\" alt=\"CurseForge\" height=\"32\"> </a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/CKjFgGdY/backgorund.png\" alt=\"Background Banner\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;font-family:sans-serif;line-height:1.6\"><span style=\"color:#fb766a\"> <strong>&raquo; 设置：</strong>在 CurseForge 设置中使用 <strong>“Mojang 启动器”</strong> 选项。<br><strong>&raquo; Linux 用户：</strong>为了稳定性，请禁用 <strong><a style=\"color:#fb766a;text-decoration:underline\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spark\" rel=\"nofollow\">Spark</a></strong> 和 <strong><a style=\"color:#fb766a;text-decoration:underline\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/iris-flywheel-compat\" rel=\"nofollow\">Iris Oculus Flywheel Compat</a></strong> 模组。<br><strong>&raquo; 内存：</strong>分配至少 <strong>6 GB</strong> 内存（推荐 8 GB）。 </span></p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center;font-weight:normal;line-height:1.5\">Linggango 是一个高度自定义的整合包，带有微妙的泰拉瑞亚灵感。<br>包含大量自定义内容、独特的机制，目前处于测试阶段，正在进行积极的更新和完善。<br><br>加入 Discord 以获取服务器包和定期开发更新。</h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/linggango\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/social/discord-plural_64h.png\" alt=\"Discord\" height=\"32\"> </a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/tTJwFS0g/523.png\" alt=\"Divider\"></strong></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>- 重构的进度系统 -</strong></h1>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center;font-weight:normal\">进度受到严格限制。关键武器、工具和里程碑被锁定，必须击败Boss才能解锁。<br><br><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/5XWQVx5X/proghint2.png\" alt=\"Progression Hint\" width=\"100%\"></h3>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><br>- 独特的玩法风格 -</strong></h1>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center;font-weight:normal\">选择你的道路。从两个起始戒指中选择一个开始你的旅程，它们将极大地改变游戏机制。</h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/WWX8p6xJ/Ekran-g-r-nt-s-2026-07-03-043452.png\" alt=\"Ring Selection\" width=\"100%\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">七咒之戒</h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/WWCjhWQ4/Ekran-g-r-nt-s-2026-07-03-043637.png\" alt=\"Ring of Seven Curses\" width=\"100%\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">七德之戒</h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/GvpyhWkp/Ekran-g-r-nt-s-2026-07-03-043650.png\" alt=\"Ring of Seven Virtues\" width=\"100%\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;font-style:italic\">这两个戒指都有独特的优缺点，可以塑造你的构建。</p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>- 60+ Boss -</strong></h1>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center;font-weight:normal\">面对大量自定义Boss阵容。准备工作至关重要。</h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/6RZpm1nX/2026-01-12-05-57-51.png\" alt=\"Boss Fight 1\" width=\"100%\"> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/xSVsdQxk/2026-01-12-06-05-42.png\" alt=\"Boss Fight 2\" width=\"100%\"> <strong><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/SXSKT21y/2026-01-12-06-02-47.png\" alt=\"Boss Fight 3\" width=\"100%\"></strong></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>- 任务系统 -</strong></h1>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center;font-weight:normal\">详细的自定义任务书引导你度过各个进度阶段并了解模组机制。</h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/fYk66Fwx/javaw-8a-T3s7ka9q.gif\" alt=\"Quest Book Demo\"></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>- 美丽的世界生成 -</strong></h1>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center;font-weight:normal\">拥有完全自定义的地形生成，专门针对 Forge 环境进行了定制。</h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/2ph4cMh/2026-06-26-16-03-43.png\" alt=\"Terrain 1\"> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/LXWgRWXL/2026-06-05-04-31-49.png\" alt=\"Terrain 2\"> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/4ZJxkvxX/2026-06-26-16-10-22.png\" alt=\"Terrain 3\"> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/rf66Wphc/2026-06-26-16-07-08.png\" alt=\"Terrain 4\" width=\"100%\"> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/S4nBRDmN/2026-06-26-16-14-37.png\" alt=\"Terrain 5\"> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/NdYPLKBt/2026-07-03-04-55-46.png\" alt=\"Terrain 6\"></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>- 优化 -</strong></h1>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center;font-weight:normal\">优化是核心重点。本整合包没有仅仅添加通用的性能优化模组，而是经过手动调优以确保稳定性。在测试期间，性能将持续提升。</h3>\n<hr style=\"border:0\">\n<div style=\"text-align:center;font-family:monospace\">\n<p><strong style=\"color:#fbeeb8;font-size:1.2em\">基准测试 1</strong></p>\n<p><strong>硬件：</strong>Ryzen 5 5600 | RX 5700 XT | 16GB RAM (3200MHz)<br><strong>设置：</strong>12 区块 | 垂直同步关闭 | Complementary 光影<br><strong>版本：</strong>v4.5~<br><span style=\"font-style:italic;color:#a3e635\">结果：帧时间稳定，120+ FPS</span></p>\n</div>\n<hr style=\"border:0\">\n<div style=\"text-align:center;font-family:monospace\">\n<p><strong style=\"color:#2dc26b;font-size:1.2em\">基准测试 2</strong></p>\n<p><strong>硬件：</strong>Ryzen 7 7800X3D | RX 7900 XT | 32GB RAM (5600MHz)<br><strong>设置：</strong>32 区块 | 垂直同步关闭 | Complementary 光影<br><strong>版本：</strong>v6.5<br><span style=\"font-style:italic;color:#a3e635\">结果：帧时间稳定，110–130 FPS</span></p>\n</div>\n<hr style=\"border:0\">\n<div style=\"text-align:center;font-family:monospace\">\n<p><strong style=\"color:#fbeeb8;font-size:1.2em\">基准测试 3</strong></p>\n<p><strong>硬件：</strong>Ryzen 5 5600X | RX 7800 XT | 32GB RAM (3600MHz)<br><strong>设置：</strong>12 区块 | 垂直同步关闭 | 关闭光影<br><strong>版本：</strong>v6.4~<br><span style=\"font-style:italic;color:#a3e635\">结果：无重大帧时间下降，500–600 FPS</span></p>\n</div>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>想和朋友一起玩吗？</strong></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">通过 Kinetic Hosting 经济实惠地托管高性能服务器。<br><br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.kinetichosting.com%252fmodpacks%252flingango%252forder\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/9mR5GxD4/z-Ikb-PZc.png\" alt=\"Kinetic Hosting Banner\"></a></p>",
